eugene levy catherine o'hara annie  murphy  daniel levy canada's golden comedy earns  five nominations in the tv categories  including best television series musical  or comedy the beloved series won best  comedy and dominated all four acting  categories at last year's emmys  and with each of its four main cast  members scoring a globe nomination  they could very well pull off another  sweep on february 28th  any idea of how you guys might celebrate  oh gosh i think well things just kind of  all fell into place for the emmys so  many of us were  already in toronto i feel like we're  going to end up doing what a bunch of us  thought we were going to do for the  emmys which is just be on our  couch in sweat  clothes but that's not stopping her  co-star dan levy from celebrating the  good news on twitter writing quote  thinking of all of the amazingly  talented people who helped make this  show  you did good team but he'll have to face  off against  another great canadian as donald  sutherland also scores a best supporting  actor nod for the hbo limited series the  undoing  in a statement he puts things simply  telling us quote  i'm thrilled just thrilled the same can  clearly be said for the flight attendant  star and first-time nominee kaylee cuoco  who calls this the highlight of her  entire career  and the great star nicholas holt is also  celebrating his first nod even carving  out some time from his at-home routine  to celebrate with carlos  i was in the kitchen doing like a little  like kitchen workout circuit  my phone started like going a bit mad  and i was like what's going on over  there  what was your first reaction when you  got the nomination when you heard  it's just so happy honestly i was like  um  have such a fun time on this show  obviously you know we're not gonna get  the typical golden globes party do you  think that you'll make plans  sort of celebrate online i don't really  know how this is going to work to be  honest with you but  i'll probably